# ============================================================
# AMIL LEGAL INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM — ENVIRONMENT TEMPLATE
# Owner: Amil Bhatt | AI Assistant: Juris — Legal Intelligence
# WARNING: Never commit real API keys, secrets, or credentials.
